# This is the first ever katipo website!

Katipo is a tool that we can use to build a better web.

I have made some games for you to play.

This is [snake](link = "katipobrowser.com/snake"). You need arrow keys on a keyboard to play at the moment.

And this is [blockout](link = "katipobrowser.com/blockout"). Use the arrow keys, or you can play on a touch screen by touching the left side of the screen to move left or the right to move right.

And this is a demo of [waraki](link = "katipobrowser.com/waraki"). Waraki is an mp3 player, and I recorded a mini podcast as an example. You can host your own music library too.

More coming soon!